      "Impedance   16 Ohms",
      "About this item",
      "JBL Pure Bass sound (10mm dynamic drivers): Whether you're listening to your favorite playlist, watching a movie, or playing a game, JBL Spatial Sound transforms the stereo sound from any source or device into a more immersive sound experience.",
      "Adaptive Noise Cancelling: tune out noises entirely or just let in as much of the outside world you want. Ambient Aware adapts how much of the outside world you want to hear, while TalkThru lets you talk with those around you while keeping your earbuds in",
