      "Real 1080P 60FPS Capture Card: UGREEN HDMI Capture Card supports input max resolution up to 4K@30Hz, output max resolution up to 1080P@60Hz. This Capture Card connects cameras, camcorders, and other audio and video signal sources via HDMI interface, and captures HDMI signals to record to USB A or USB C devices. It is great for you to record videos & audio clearly at any time for streaming",
